---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="小江户川越 藏造街景｜锦乃｜WORKS"
  description=""
>


<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 768px)"
      srcset="/images/kawagoekurazukuri-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/kawagoe.jpg"
      alt="藏造街景"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>


  <!-- Content -->

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          KOEDO KAWAGOE　KURAZUKURI STREET
        </p>


        <!-- Title -->

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[48px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          小江户川越<br>藏造街景
        </h1>


        <!-- Subtitle -->

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          充满江户风情的传统日式街景。
        </p>


        <!-- Gold Divider -->

        <div class="mt-1">

          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />

        </div>


        <!-- Summary -->

        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>


  <!-- Scroll -->

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <!-- Washi Background -->

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />


  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">


    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        作品概要
      </h2>


      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        小江户川越藏造街景是埼玉县川越市最具代表性的历史街景之一。<br>
        自江户时代起，川越作为商业城镇不断发展。厚重的藏造商铺鳞次栉比的街景以「小江户」之名广为人知，至今仍保留着浓厚的历史风貌。
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl">
    </div>



    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <!-- Left -->

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          关于川越一番街商店街藏造街景
        </h2>


        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          位于埼玉县川越市的小江户川越一番街藏造街景，
          是江户时代作为城下町发展起来的川越中心城区至今保留下来的历史景观。
          川越作为川越藩的城下町繁荣发展，同时也凭借与江户之间的水运物流，成为重要的商业中心。

          <br><br>

          如今这片藏造街景的形成，与明治26年（1893年）发生的「川越大火」有着密切关系。
          这场大火之后，为提高防火性能，大量采用土藏造结构的商铺得到重建，黑色灰泥厚重外墙、观音开门式门扇、
          瓦屋顶以及虫笼窗等具有藏造建筑特色的建筑逐渐在街道两旁林立。

          <br><br>

          如今的街景中，仍保存着许多留有昔日风貌的藏造商铺、町家、寺院以及藏等建筑。
          这里至今仍能感受到从江户时代到明治时代、再由明治时代延续至现代的历史氛围，
          并被选定为「重要传统建筑群保存地区」，其高度的历史与文化价值也得到了认可。

          <br><br>

          我将这片充满历史的街景，以真实的我的世界日式建筑形式重新呈现。
          作品并非根据设计图制作，而是以古老照片和现实中的建筑为依据进行忠实再现，
          并因此被新闻媒体报道，受到了许多人的关注。制作过程与完成后的作品也在X和YouTube上公开。

        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- DATA -->

      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>


          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品名称</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                小江户川越 一番街商店街 藏造街景
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">分类</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                日式建筑・日式街景
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">起源</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                江户时代宽永年间 城市规划始于宽永16年（1639年）～
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">所在地</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                〒350-0063 埼玉县川越市幸町・仲町周边（川越一番街商店街）
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">现存街景形成</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                1893年（明治26年・川越大火后重建）
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">特色</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                藏造建筑・商铺・住宅
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作软件</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                我的世界 Java Edition 1.21.4~1.21.8
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品类型</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                日式建筑・街景复原
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作状态</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                已完成
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        展示照片
      </h2>


      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/kawagoe1.png"
            alt="川越一番街"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/kawagoe.jpg"
            alt="川越一番街"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/kawagoe2.png"
            alt="川越一番街"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/kawagoe3.png"
            alt="川越一番街实景"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 返回作品一览
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://x.com/nishikinolab/status/1908105135102058944/photo/1"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        查看更多作品 →
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://nlab.itmedia.co.jp/cont/articles/3398021/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        查看相关报道 →
      </a>


               <!-- Share -->
    
      <div class="mt-32 w-full text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          分享作品
        </h2>


        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

          <!-- X -->

          <a
            href="#"
            id="x-share"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>


          <!-- Instagram -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>


          <!-- Copy -->

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            复制URL
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>



<script>

  const sharePhrases = [
    "找到这个了。",
    "这个莫名有点喜欢。",
    "看看这个。",
    "发现了个挺让人在意的东西。",
    "发现了这个。",
    "你知道这个吗？",
    "发现了个东西。",
    "原来还有这个。",
    "发现了个有点在意的东西。"
  ];


  const randomPhrase =
    sharePhrases[
      Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)
    ];


  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/zh-cn/kawagoekurazukuri/";


  const shareText =
    `${randomPhrase} Minecraft 小江户川越 藏造街景 | WORKS`;


  const xShareButton =
    document.getElementById("x-share");


  if (xShareButton) {

    xShareButton.setAttribute(
      "href",
      `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
    );

  }


  const copyButton =
    document.getElementById("copy-url");


  const instagramButton =
    document.getElementById("instagram-share");


  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

    try {

      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {

        copyButton.textContent = "已复制";

        setTimeout(() => {

          copyButton.textContent = "复制URL";

        }, 2000);

      }

    } catch (error) {

      console.error(error);

    }

  });


  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog =
      document.createElement("div");


    dialog.innerHTML = `

      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >

        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>


          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            在Instagram上分享
          </h3>


          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            复制此作品页面的URL后<br>
            打开Instagram。
          </p>


          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            复制URL并打开Instagram
          </button>


          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            取消
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    `;


    document.body.appendChild(dialog);


    const overlay =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-share-overlay"
      );


    const openButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-open"
      );


    const cancelButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-cancel"
      );


    openButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      async () => {

        try {

          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(
            pageUrl
          );

        } catch (error) {

          console.error(error);

        }


        window.open(
          "https://www.instagram.com/",
          "_blank",
          "noopener,noreferrer"
        );


        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    cancelButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      () => {

        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    overlay?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      (event) => {

        if (event.target === overlay) {

          overlay.remove();

        }

      }
    );

  });

</script>


<style>

.work-hero {

  animation:
    heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;

  transform-origin:
    center;

}


@keyframes heroFloat {

  0% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

  50% {

    transform:
      scale(1.06)
      translateY(-18px);

  }

  100% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

}


section {

  position:
    relative;

}


section::before {

  content:
    "";

  position:
    absolute;

  left:
    0;

  top:
    0;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    100%;

  pointer-events:
    none;

  background-image:

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 8% 10%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.08),
      transparent 18%
    ),

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 92% 82%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.06),
      transparent 22%
    );

}


aside {

  position:
    sticky;

  top:
    120px;

  height:
    max-content;

}


a {

  transition:
    .35s;

}




.gallery-frame {

  position:
    relative;

  padding:
    2px;

  border-radius:
    1.25rem;

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow:
    hidden;

}


.gallery-frame img {

  display:
    block;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    auto;

  border-radius:
    calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background:
    #f8f6f2;

}


.gallery-frame:hover {

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

}


@media (max-width:1100px) {

  section {

    overflow:
      hidden;

  }

}


@media (max-width:900px) {

  .gallery {

    grid-template-columns:
      1fr;

  }


  aside {

    position:
      relative;

    top:
      auto;

  }

}


@media (max-width:768px) {

  section:first-child {

    height:
      760px;

  }



  .gallery-frame {

    border-radius:
      1rem;

  }


  .gallery-frame img {

    border-radius:
      calc(1rem - 2px);

  }

}

</style>

</Layout>